  "method": "Each CSPA player matched (accent-folded) to data/sets/2026-bowman-chrome-baseball.json group cpa, whose flags were verified card-by-card on Sep 9 2026; 33/33 matched and flagged 1st. One checklist row (Eric Hartman, BSPA-EHA — on the Topps PDF, Oct 8) did not match and is left out (see note). BCP rows copied from September's bcp group with their flags.",
